{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-627342759493239661 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=627342759409222509&sectionId=627342759493239661)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","label":"ggHgdpFk1JX_text","default":"Why Personalized Gifts Create Stronger Emotional Connections"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFEamEG7Tu_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggFEamEG7Tu_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://gempages-demo.myshopify.com/cdn/shop/t/1/assets/495611768014373769-1d8ab5cd-34d1-43cc-ab47-08c6e231f190.png?v=181822651097244608941704974446"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBvZZRZkdM_text","label":"ggBvZZRZkdM_text","default":"<p>By <strong>Memobrick</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6gUx5Ogqp_text","label":"gg6gUx5Ogqp_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#161723;\"><strong>Published:</strong></span> Monday, January 8, 2024</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggXaq5atd8t_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggXaq5atd8t_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/354300e6-9f5d-4d51-b5e1-0da63d90ae1d.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","label":"ggy1bllNyNr_text","default":"<p>Giving a gift is more than simply exchanging an item—it's a way to express love, appreciation, and celebrate life's most meaningful moments. While any gift can bring a smile, personalized gifts create a deeper emotional connection because they're made with a specific person and memory in mind. Whether it's a birthday, anniversary, graduation, or holiday, a custom keepsake like a Memobrick transforms a favorite photo into a meaningful piece of art, creating memories that can be treasured for years to come.</p><p>In this guide, we'll explore why personalized gifts leave a lasting impression and how they help strengthen the emotional connections between family, friends, and loved ones.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","label":"ggxSH6D-B6E_text","default":"Why Personalized Gifts Mean More"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","label":"ggbYXQJkaEx_text","default":"<p>Personalized gifts go beyond their material value by celebrating shared memories, important milestones, and meaningful relationships. They show extra thought and effort because they're created specifically for the recipient, making them feel appreciated and understood. Whether it's a cherished family photo, a memorable vacation, or a special celebration, personalized keepsakes become lasting reminders of moments that matter most.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","label":"ggwpvVuN5GH_text","default":"Why Memobrick Creates Stronger Emotional Connections"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","label":"ggkgPuwBygs_text","default":"<p><strong>1. Turn Memories Into Something You Can Build</strong></p><p>Upload your favorite photo and transform it into a personalized brick mosaic that celebrates life's most meaningful moments.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdRqYRsHYS_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggdRqYRsHYS_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/f60cf967-4cbe-4583-9e89-5ca2e931d057.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","label":"ggGXZ7YumrL_text","default":"<p><strong>2. Create Lasting Memories Together</strong></p><p>Building a Memobrick is more than completing a project—it's a fun experience that families, couples, and friends can enjoy together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZYvJr_3O6_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggZYvJr_3O6_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/af21e414-768f-42c3-8f0b-7596747667c9.png"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","label":"gg6DeOkdcmM_text","default":"<p><strong>3. A Keepsake That Lasts</strong></p><p>Unlike flowers or ordinary gifts, Memobrick is designed to be displayed and treasured for years as a reminder of a special memory.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPk9YJU542_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggPk9YJU542_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/1a088b08-b54d-4130-8dc9-410c3fe8a83a.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNM59-eiXD_text","label":"ggNM59-eiXD_text","default":"<p><strong>4. Made for Every Special Occasion</strong></p><p>Whether it's a birthday, anniversary, graduation, wedding, holiday, or pet memorial, Memobrick turns unforgettable moments into personalized keepsakes.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggImlnWGxu-_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggImlnWGxu-_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/99fe6d64-4a80-437d-8d7a-14425bff2e3c.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggV2-sf87rR_text","label":"ggV2-sf87rR_text","default":"<strong>When to Give a Personalized Gift</strong>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzVz3his-x_text","label":"ggzVz3his-x_text","default":"<ul><li>Birthdays</li><li>Anniversaries</li><li>Weddings</li><li>Graduations</li><li>Mother's Day</li><li>Father's Day</li><li>Christmas</li><li>Valentine's Day</li><li>Pet Memorials</li><li>Housewarming Gifts</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","label":"gg0g4QSz3Qm_text","default":"Why Personalized Gifts Are More Memorable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","label":"ggqdnyWPuN6_text","default":"<p>Studies have shown that people often value gifts with personal meaning more than expensive items without emotional significance. A personalized gift reflects shared experiences, inside jokes, favorite moments, and milestones, making it something the recipient is more likely to keep, display, and cherish for years.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","label":"ggomhSDqLq4_text","default":"<p>The most memorable gifts aren't measured by their price—they're remembered because of the emotions they carry. Personalized gifts celebrate the people, moments, and milestones that matter most, turning everyday memories into lifelong keepsakes. Whether you're celebrating a birthday, anniversary, graduation, or another special occasion, a custom Memobrick offers a unique way to preserve those meaningful moments and create a gift that will be treasured for years to come.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggBOtzsGqsp_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/reviesa.jpg"},{"type":"html","id":"ggZOdCf74rl_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggZOdCf74rl_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://gempages-demo.myshopify.com/cdn/shop/t/1/assets/495611768014373769-ef8ac6a5-a4c5-4b08-b9c0-fe972cadf6b6_768x768.png?v=4640590167630680311705458916"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","label":"gg1zn5xrx2V_text","default":"<p>Frequently Asked Questions</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_0","default":"<p>Why are personalized gifts more meaningful?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_1","default":"<p>Are personalized gifts good for any occasion?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_2","default":"<p>How many bricks are included in a Memobrick?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_3","default":"<p>How long will it take to see results?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_4","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_4","default":"<p>Why is Memobrick a meaningful gift?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_5","label":"ggMORWn2MU9_childItem_5","default":"<p>Is there a free review for my photo?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","label":"gg6Bh6tsP-K_text","default":"<p>They celebrate unique memories and show extra thought, making the recipient feel appreciated and valued.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLojdV256l_text","label":"ggLojdV256l_text","default":"<p>Yes! Personalized gifts are perfect for birthdays, anniversaries, graduations, weddings, holidays, and many other special occasions.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","label":"gg1lfuZ-9YC_text","default":"<p>The number of bricks depends on the size of the Memobrick you choose or purchase.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","label":"ggvI9Uf6sv4_text","default":"<p>Your preview is typically ready within 2–3 business days after your order is placed.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaWTKFvINw_text","label":"ggaWTKFvINw_text","default":"<p>Memobrick transforms a favorite photo into a personalized brick mosaic, creating both a memorable building experience and a keepsake that lasts for years.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggI_oEBemGD_text","label":"ggI_oEBemGD_text","default":"<p>Yes! We offer a free preview. Simply scroll down to the Help section and select Free Proof to request your preview.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewMoreText","default":"Show more"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","label":"ggeNKHTvIpw_viewLessText","default":"Show less"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","label":"ggLPDL01sbI_text","default":"Quantity"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out of stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMessage","label":"ggaIrtgvQpt_errorMes